// 289's guild door is loc_2025, which 2011 does not have: its guild was
// reworked on 23 March 2010 (2011 wiki, Master fisher) and is entered by the
// double gate 49014 and 49016 at 2613-2614,3386 (cache 786 map; 2011 wiki,
// Fishing Guild: "The fishing guild gates"). barriers.loc wires those as
// ordinary gates, which open for a while to anyone; 289 lets a player through
// its door and shuts it behind them, and 2011's gates would need the same
// walk-through on a double gate. That belongs with the doors, so the level
// check waits for them.
